{
  "title": "Frodhes",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Physical models of",
        "an electric piano",
        "(four types), a",
        "vibraphone and a",
        "marimba. No samples.",
        "TYPE on the first",
        "page picks the",
        "instrument; its",
        "VOICE pages follow",
        "it.",
        "",
        "SUS holds the notes",
        "as the sustain pedal",
        "does; a pedal on CC",
        "64 works too. On the",
        "PEDAL screen the",
        "Capture button is",
        "the pedal: hold it,",
        "or tap to latch and",
        "tap again to let go."
      ]
    },
